  "discordPostHtml": "<p>Collection of various rules and challenges for Unofficial New Game Plus by Originem.</p><p>Adds 16 negative, 5 positive, 1 golden negative, 1 golden positive, 5 milestones and 1 golden milestone rules as well as 1 background.</p><p>If anyone finds a bug or a crash, or just has any feedback, feel free to ping me (actually I oblige you to).</p><p>Forum post: <code>Maybe someday later</code><br>GitHub: <a href=\"https://github.com/DemonX3/URB\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">https://github.com/DemonX3/URB</a><br>Direct download: <a href=\"https://github.com/DemonX3/URB/releases/download/1.3.0/URB_v1.3.0.zip\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">https://github.com/DemonX3/URB/releases/download/1.3.0/URB_v1.3.0.zip</a><br>Requires UNGP and MagicLib</p><pre><code>v1.3.0 as of 18.08.2024\nContent:\n- Added 3 negative rules.\n- Added 1 background.\n\nChanges:\n- Version shifted to Starsector 0.97\n- 'Antagonizm':\n - Moved blacklist check up in priority.\n - Added 'Stored Frigate' hullmod from 'Indies Expansion' (or 'Aerial Combat Suite', whatever) to the blacklist.\n- Moved 'Thin Insulator' rule to combat layer.\n- Temporarily disabled visual range circle of 'Doomslayer', it still works.</code></pre>",
